      "solution_text": "$x^{2}-12x+4=0$\n1. **Complete the square.**\n$(x-6)^{2}-36+4=0$\n$(x-6)^{2}=32$\n2. **Solve for $x$.**\n$x-6=\\pm\\sqrt{32}$\n$x-6=\\pm4\\sqrt{2}$\n$x=6\\pm4\\sqrt{2}$"
